    <briefdescription>
<para>Static rendering API for drawing 2D geometry. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classRenderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> provides a simple interface for drawing textured or untextured quads using the engine&apos;s shader and buffer objects. All methods are static, making it easy to use from anywhere in the engine.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The <ref refid="classRenderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> assumes that the shader already has the correct uniforms for the model, view, and projection matrices, as well as a texture sampler. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classShader" kindref="compound">Shader</ref>, <ref refid="classVertexArray" kindref="compound">VertexArray</ref>, <ref refid="classIndexBuffer" kindref="compound">IndexBuffer</ref>, <ref refid="classTexture2D" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
